---@field enhancedSchemeData? adyen.EnhancedSchemeData Enhanced scheme data that may be required for processing the payment. For example, airline information.
---@field lineItems? adyen.CreatePaymentCaptureRequestLineItemsList Price and product information of the refunded items, required for [partial refunds](https://docs.adyen.com/online-payments/refund#refund-a-payment). > This field is required for partial refunds with 3x 4x Oney, Affirm, Afterpay, Atome, Clearpay, Klarna, Ratepay, Walley, and Zip.
